# ---------- 构建产物 ----------
build/

# ---------- 运行时输出（PPM 是文本格式，1 MB 起，不入库） ----------
# 要展示的成品图请归档到 gallery/
output/

# ---------- IDE ----------
.vscode/*
!.vscode/c_cpp_properties.json
.idea/

# ---------- 编译中间文件 ----------
*.o
*.obj
*.exe

# !! Exception: Wavefront OBJ models also use the .obj suffix (same as MSVC object files).
# Git ignore rules are ORDER-SENSITIVE: a later rule overrides an earlier one.
!models/*.obj

# ---------- 编译器预处理输出（t2.i = 14 万行 / 6 MB，纯构建产物） ----------
*.i
*.ii
*.s